### ========================================
### HEALTH CHECK
### ========================================

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health


### ========================================
### AUTHENTICATION
### ========================================

### 1. Register New User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Register Another User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 3. Login User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 4. Login Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 5. Login with Wrong Password (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### 6. Register with Duplicate Username (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "another@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 7. Register with Invalid Email (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newuser",
  "email": "invalidemail",
  "password": "password123"
}


### ========================================
### PROTECTED ROUTES (Need Token)
### ========================================

### 8. Get User Profile (Protected)
# First login and copy the token, then replace @token variable above
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Get All Users (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Access Protected Route Without Token (Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/profile

### 11. Access Protected Route with Invalid Token (Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_here


### ========================================
### USER MANAGEMENT
### ========================================

### 12. Get User by ID (Admin Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Update Own Profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newemail@example.com",
  "full_name": "Updated Name"
}

### 14. Update User by Admin
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin_updated@example.com",
  "full_name": "Admin Updated Name",
  "role": "admin"
}

### 15. Change Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "old_password": "password123",
  "new_password": "newpassword123"
}

### 16. Delete User (Admin Only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17. Try Update Other User (Should Fail for Non-Admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Trying to update other user"
}

### 18. Try Delete User (Should Fail for Non-Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================
### NOTES:
### ========================================
# 1. Start server first: go run main.go
# 2. Use VS Code REST Client extension or copy to Postman
# 3. After login, copy the token from response
# 4. Replace @token variable with your actual token
# 5. Test protected routes with valid token


### ========================================
### EZYTIX MOBILE API - FULL TEST SUITE
### ========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@jwtSecret = your-super-secret-jwt-key-change-this-in-production

# Langkah: 
# 1. Login
# 2. Copy Token dari response
# 3. Paste ke variable @token di bawah ini
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
@adminToken = PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

