}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ----------------------------------------
### 4. VOLTRAS FLIGHT INTEGRATION
### ----------------------------------------

### Get Voltras Office Info (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voltras/office-info

### Search Flights
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voltras/flight/search
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "origin": "CGK",
  "destination": "DPS",
  "departure_date": "2026-06-20",
  "adults": 1,
  "trip_type": "OW"
}

### Retrieve Fare
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voltras/flight/fare/retrieve
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "flight_key": "FLIGHT_KEY_DATA",
  "class_code": "Y"
}

### Book Flight
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voltras/flight/book
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "flight_key": "FLIGHT_KEY_DATA",
  "class_code": "Y",
  "contact_name": "Thoriq",
  "contact_email": "thoriq@ezytix.com",
  "contact_phone": "08123456789",
  "passengers": [
    {
      "type": "ADT",
      "title": "MR",
      "first_name": "Muhammad",
      "last_name": "Thoriq",
      "nationality": "ID"
    }
  ]
}

### Retrieve PNR
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voltras/flight/pnr/retrieve
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "pnr": "ABCDEF"
}


### ----------------------------------------
### 5. SERVICES & MASTER DATA
### ----------------------------------------

### Get Countries
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/services/countries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Airports
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/services/airports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Airlines
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/services/airlines
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get VA Banks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/services/va-banks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Transaction (Payment)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/services/payment/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "booking_id": 1,
  "payment_method": "VIRTUAL_ACCOUNT",
  "bank_code": "BCA",
  "amount": 1500000
}

### Get Balance Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/services/balance/08123456789
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ----------------------------------------
### 6. BOOKINGS HISTORY
### ----------------------------------------

### Get My Bookings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Booking Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


